<sect1 id="sect-compile"><title>Compilation and installation</title>
<para>
In order to compile and install SpDrS60 on your system, type the
following in the base directory of the SpDrS60 distribution:</para>

<screen>
% ./configure
% make
% make install
</screen>

<para>
Since SpDrS60 uses <filename class="directory">autoconf</filename> you
should have not trouble compiling it.
Should you run into problems please report them to the the author at 
<ulink url="mailto:info@linux-modellbahn.de">Stefan Preis</ulink>
</para>
</sect1>

